---
alwaysApply: true
---

E2E tests that encode **current** Source of Truth are product requirements.

Do not modify current-requirement tests simply to make them pass.
Fix the implementation instead.

Only modify or remove tests when the authoritative product requirement has changed
(Product Charter / source-of-truth-index / current architecture).

Historical, superseded, or explicitly retired E2E axes (for example Route Processing
OFF / legacy stream-scoped runtime) are not product requirements. Reclassify or
remove them; never resurrect retired architecture to satisfy them.
